+than 120 counted exact operations.  Box landmarks, bounded residual descent,
+structure-aware random restarts, and a two-decimal by-hand centroid ansatz are
+tested as failing attacks.  The exact compact solver is disclosed under
+compact_route, not misreported as a failed attack.
+""".strip()
