+        "2,151,529 lattice evaluations, 8,637,629 exact operations, and about "
+        "4.0 seconds at the shipping preset, while Vieta's root centroid followed by continued-fraction "
+        "rational reconstruction uses fewer than 120 exact operations; the paper's "
+        "Sections 3-4 also give effective PARI/GP and continued-fraction methods, "
+        "so no Track-A claim is made."
