| G5 density and cost | pass locally; Theorem 1 gives one answer, density `3.9159787597312074e-7`; strongest failing attack tested 65,536 candidates in 0.10 s total, while the exact reference scan averaged 2,151,529 evaluations and 0.22 s |
| G6 adversaries | pass: landmarks, 48-step residual descent, 8,192 restarts, and two-decimal centroid each score 0/8; reference scan and compact route each score 8/8 |
